//! Codegen module root — re-exports for the TML LLVM IR emitter.
//!
//! This module provides the TML implementation of the LLVM IR text emitter,
//! replacing the C++ codegen in `compiler/src/codegen/`. It takes a `MirModule`
//! (produced by the MIR builder in compiler-tml/src/mir/) and emits LLVM IR
//! text that can be compiled to native code by LLVM.
//!
//! ## Architecture
//!
//! ```
//! codegen/
//!   common.tml     — this file, module root and re-exports
//!   config.tml     — CodegenConfig: target triple, data layout, opt level
//!   types.tml      — LlvmType enum: I1..I128, F32/F64, Ptr, Struct, Array, Func, Void
//!   emit_type.tml  — emit_type(MirType) -> Str: MIR type → LLVM IR type string
//!   layout.tml     — LayoutComputer: size/alignment/field-offsets per MirType
//!   emit_func.tml  — emit_func_decl(MirFunc) -> Str: define/declare line + sret/byval
//!   emit_module.tml — emit_module(MirModule) -> Str: complete LLVM IR file
//! ```
//!
//! Phase 16a — item 1.1.

